1745
01:18:20,130 --> 01:18:22,590
And this is true for
organizations too.

1746
01:18:22,590 --> 01:18:25,510
And if the episode
lengths are always finite,

1747
01:18:25,510 --> 01:18:28,030
you can always-- bless
