1749
01:18:31,380 --> 01:18:33,118
But when you have
infinite horizons,

1750
01:18:33,118 --> 01:18:35,160
it's generally important
to make this less than 1

1751
01:18:35,160 --> 01:18:37,153
so your rewards don't blow up.

1752
01:18:37,153 --> 01:18:38,820
Part of that is because
it's really hard

1753
01:18:38,820 --> 01:18:41,970
