1755
01:18:43,678 --> 01:18:45,220
is better than this
other policy that

1756
01:18:45,220 --> 01:18:47,400
has infinite reward, whereas
you can keep everything

1757
01:18:47,400 --> 01:18:50,490
bounded if you have
a gamma less than 1.

1758
